{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1254341-puppy-face-0-dots-new-merit-idea","id":1254341,"title":"Puppy Face (0 dots) - New Merit idea","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-14T15:14:23-07:00","id":1254341,"title":"Puppy Face (0 dots) - New Merit idea","content":"My ST and I were talking about different ways different people tend to use appearance, and how the idea of a high Appearance being either amazingly beautiful or terrifyingly ugly seemed problematic. As we were discussing this, we came up with the idea of someone having an 'honest face' or a 'puppy face' like in the thread title. The merit would be something like this:<br /> <br /> Honest Face (0-dots) - Innate<br /> A character with this trait has an exceedingly honest look to them. People find themselves trusting this character despite themselves, even when never having spoken to them. Other Characters find it difficult to turn down a request they make even while putting less stock in their opinions or arguments since their honestly also gets linked with the idea of innocence or being less important. A character with this merit does not compare their appearance against another character's resolve to gain a bonus when making instill actions. Instead, they use their appearance to gain this bonus on Bargain or Persuade Actions.<br /> <br /> Does anyone else have any thoughts on good merits of this type that would change how your appearance is used in character?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath